        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Laitornatetab Hesekia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitau Hesekia kolaitorani ko bo kenyisiek tiptem ak mut; ak kilaitoran kenyisiek tiptem ak sogol eng’ Jerusalem: ak kigiguure kamennyi Abija cheptab Sekaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiyai ne mie eng’ taitab Jehovah, ko u tugul che kiyai Daudi kwandanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiyat kurgotikab gotab Jehovah, eng’ kenyit ne bo tai ne bo laitornatennyi, eng’ arawet ne bo tai, ak koteech kogeny ole kiga kobutok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiimut tisiik ak Lawik kobwa go, ak koyumji ichek komosta ne baraa eng’ kong’asis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kolenji, Ogas, okwek Lawik; oanyinyge, ak oanyiny gotab Jehovah, Kamuktaindetab kwanisiekyok, ak omaande tugukab simdo eng’ ole tilil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kigochiliil kwanisiekyok, ak koyai ne ya eng’ taitab Jehovah Kamuktaindennyo, ak kigometo inendet, ak kowelelgei kometo ole menyei Jehovah, ak kotuktochi batai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigoger kurgotikab keterut, ak komis taisiek, mata kobeel nyamdutik anan kogoito tiseiywek che kibeelei eng’ ole tilil, kogochi Kamuktaindetab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinyonji anyun neregekab Jehovah Juda ak Jerusalem, ak kiigoito ichek ketoortaat koba komosi ak komosi, koek kwong’utiet, ak koek che kirenyei ko u ye ogeere eng’ konyekwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu, ogeero, kigebar kwanisiekyok eng’ rotokab chok, ak kigeluul werikyok ak tibikyok ak osotikyok amu nito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara anyun, mi muguleldanyu kiyomisge ak Jehovah Kamuktaindetab Israel, si keistoenech neregekyik che koromen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Werikyuk, amata oegu che maigiilegei: amu kilewenok Jehovah otonone tainnyi, oboisiechi inendet, ak oegu kiboitinikyik, ak obeel nyamdutik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’eetyo anyun Lawik, Mahat weritab Amasai, ak Joel weritab Asaria, eng’ werikab Kohatik: ak eng’ werikab Merari, Kis weritab Abdi, ak Asaria weritab Jealelel: ak eng’ Gersonik, Joa weritab Sima, ak Eden weritab Joa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eng’ werikab Elisapan, Simri ak Jeuel: ak eng’ werikab Asap, Sekaria ak Matania: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak eng’ werikab Heman, Jehuel ak Simei: ak eng’ werikab Jedutun, Semaia ak Usiel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiiyum tupchosiekwak, ak koanyinygei, ak koba go, ko u ng’atutietab laitoriat eng’ ng’alekab Jehovah, kotilil gotab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiba tisiik komosta ne bo orit mising’ eng’ gotab Jehovah, koba kotilil, ak komaanda tugul che bo simdo che kiganyorji hekalutab Jehovah, ak koib koba seremutab gotab Jehovah. Ak kinam Lawik, ak koib koba timin, kowirji kererutab Kidron.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitoi anyun koanyinyis eng’ betut ne bo tai ne bo arawet ne bo tai, ak kibwa eng’ betut ne bo sisiit ne bo arawet, keterutab Jehovah; ak kiianyiny gotab Jehovah betusiek sisiit: ak kiiges eng’ betutab taman ak lo eng’ arawanato bo tai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiba anyun ole mi Hesekia laitoriat eng’ go, ak kolenji, Kagitilil got tugul ne bo Jehovah, ak kaptisisiet ne bo kagochinoik che kibeelei, koboto terenikyik tugul, ak mesetab makatinikab kabartaet, koboto tugukyik tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kogeny, kogechob tuguk tugul che kiga wirta laitoriat Ahas eng’ laitornatennyi, ye kiga kobistoe, ak kianyiny; keero, mi taitab kaptisisietab Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’eet anyun Hesekia laitoriat karon inne, ak koyum bounikab nganaset, ak kotogosta gotab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiget kirugik tisab, ak mengichik tisab, ak arekab kechir tisab, ak kwesik tisab koek kagochinetab tengekto ne bo bounatet ak ne bo ole tilil ak ne bo Juda. Ak king’at tisiik werikab Aron kogoito choto eng’ kaptisisietab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kieny anyun kirugik, ak kotaach tisiik korotik, ak koise kaptisisiet; ak kieny mengichik, ak koise korotik kaptisisiet; ak kieny arekab kechir, ak koise korotik kaptisisiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiget kwesikab kagochinetab tengekto korik taitab laitoriat ak tuiyet; ak kiigonoor eunekwak baragunywa: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak kieny tisiik, ak kiigoito korotikwak eng’ kaptisisiet koek kagochinetab tengekto, si koyai kagaigaet agobo Israel tugul: amu king’at laitoriat kole kigoito kagochinet ne kibeelei ak kagochinetab tengekto agobo Israel tugul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiinde Lawik gotab Jehovah, kotinyei sanisiekab sugunonik che kibirei, ak kibugandinik ak ketubosiek, ko u ng’atutietab Daudi, ak ne bo Gad keerindetab laitoriat, ak maotiot Natan: amu kibunu ng’atutionoto Jehovah eng’ maotikyik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kitononso Lawik kotinyei kibugandinikab Daudi, kotinyei tisiik iriagok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak king’at Hesekia kigoito kagochinet ne kibeelei eng’ kaptisisiet. Ak kingetoi kigoito kagochinet ne kibeelei, ketoi tiendab Jehovah agine, ak iriagok koboto kibugandinikab Daudi laitoriatab Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiing’urukso tuiyet tugul, ak kotienso tienik, ak koguut iriagok bik che kuutei; kiyai ko u noto agoi kogesgei kagochinet ne kigibeelei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingo kagoges kagoitoet tugul, kong’uruk laitoriat koboto tugul che kimi ak inendet, ak kolos. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "King’at kogeny laitoriat Hesekia ak bounik, Lawik kotienji Jehovah kalosunoik eng’ ng’alekab Daudi, ak che bo Asap keerindet. Ak kitien kalosunoik eng’ kagasetab ge, ak kiing’urukso ak kolos.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeityo kowol Hesekia kole, Amu kaotabanjige Jehovah, origu oibu tiseiywek ak kagochinoikab kongoi kobwa gotab Jehovah. Ak kiib tuiyet tiseiywek ak kagochinoikab kongoi; ak kiib tugul che kichamei eng’ mugulelwekwak, kagochinoik che kibeelei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiek koitetab kagochinoik che kibeelei, che kiget tuiyet, kirugik tamanwogik tisab, ak mengichik bogol, ak arekab kechir bogol aeng’: ki bo choto tugul kagochinoik che kibeeljin Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiek tuguk che kigitaban eik bogol lo ak kechirek elfusiek somok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ago ki ng’ering’ tisiik, kot ko ma imuch koeny kagochinoik tugul che kibeelei: kotoret anyun Lawik tupchosiekwak, kot kogesgei boisionoto, ak agoi koanyinygei tisiik: amu ki lititen mugulelwekab Lawik che kichamei koanyinygei kosiir tisiik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ki chang’ kogeny kagochinoik che kibeelei, koboto mwanikab kagochinoikab kalyet, koboto kagochinoikab tuguk che kieei che bo kagochinet age tugul ne kibeelei. Kigitet anyun otisiet eng’ gotab Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibaibait Hesekia, koboto bik tugul, amu otisionoto kiga chopchi Kamuktaindet bik: amu kiyaak ng’olyondonoto eng’ yoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
